{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shovel Lands</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced 2D digging platformer</strong>. <strong>Dig, dash, and fight</strong> your way through a world full of obstacles and danger. Explore and uncover the mystery behind the corrupted crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is inspired by games like Celeste, Donkey Kong Country or Ori. Dig your way through <strong>handcrafted levels</strong> and enjoy the visually striking art and music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/Dig-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1749544585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/DiggingFghting-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1749544585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic digging mechanics:</strong> Dig and dash through diverse terrain. Interact with the environment and turn hazards to your advantage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/FaultedTendril.gif?t=1749544585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple, precise controls:</strong> Easy to learn, hard to master. Your dash combines combat, terrain interaction, and movement into a single action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade your shovel:</strong> Unleash new abilities and take your gameplay to the next level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/FlySlide.gif?t=1749544585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique biomes and mines</strong> with individual mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Encounter numerous traps, enemies, and bosses</strong> on your descent into the depths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/TNT-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1749544585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rescue allies</strong> and discover their stories. Build a community together with them</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brutally tough hardcore versions of levels</strong> for an extra thrill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable speedrun challenges</strong> for the fastest diggers out there</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792380?t=1749544585","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792380?t=1749544585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/f5fb299346f4650fc84f67c157e1111862517f3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749544585","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/f5fb299346f4650fc84f67c157e1111862517f3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749544585","categories":[{"description":"Single-playe